            <description>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Wholesale Print Batch now prints directly to the label printer saved in Settings, without a system print dialog.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Print Options remains available for changing printer, page range or copies. PDF export is unchanged.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Direct printing sends one copy of each reviewed label at the correct label size and preserves review and reprint safeguards.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
